From: 4TheDoctor <62601652+4TheDoctor@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 03:00:37 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(patches): add claudio-tricolor prompt border

Draw the prompt input's rules in the Italian flag's green, white and red,
split by screen column, scrolling sideways while a turn runs and standing
still otherwise. Two modules change: Ink's border painter paints flag runs
for boxes whose style carries claudioPhase, and the prompt component routes
its rule boxes through a wrapper that ticks that phase while isLoading.
Bash mode and agent-coloured borders keep their own colour.

Always on when named in --patches; used by Claudio's own patched copy.
